+## Summary of Changes
+
+1. **Dependency Addition & Supply Chain Hardening (`openai==3.49.0`):**
+   - Added `openai==3.49.0` (Apache-2.0 permissive, zero copyleft) to `agent/pyproject.toml` runtime dependencies.
