-# Reality-Checker Verification Packet: KANBA-44 (KB-P1-13)
-
-**Ticket:** KANBA-44 (`KB-P1-13`)
-**Title:** [Phase 1 / Database] role_bindings, resource_acl_entries & materialized effective_resource_access
-**Epic:** KB-E1
